{"ref":"BDB, אֶזְרָחִי","hw":"אֶזְרָחִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֶזְרָחִי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent.</strong> i.e. of family of <span dir=\"rtl\">זֶרַח</span>, only in <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיתָן הָא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.11\">1 K 5:11</a> (𝔊L Ἰσραηλίτης), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:1\" href=\"/Psalms.89.1\">ψ 89:1</a> (𝔊 <em>id.</em>), and <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:1\" href=\"/Psalms.88.1\">88:1</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵימָן הָא׳</span>, both sons of <span dir=\"rtl\">זֶרַח</span> (<a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.6\">1 Ch 2:6</a>).","next":"BDB, יִזְרָ֑ח","prev":"BDB, אֶזְרָח²"}